2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Heart\040energy\040signature\040spectrogram\040for\040cardiovascular\040diagnosis\056)
/Author (Vladimir\040Kudriavtsev\054\040V\056\040Polyshchuk\054\040Douglas\040L\056\040Roy)
/Subject (A\040new\040method\040and\040application\040is\040proposed\040to\040characterize\040intensity\040and\040pitch\040of\040human\040heart\040sounds\040and\040murmurs\056\040Using\040recorded\040heart\040sounds\040from\040the\040library\040of\040one\040of\040the\040authors\054\040a\040visual\040map\040of\040heart\040sound\040energy\040was\040established\056\040Both\040normal\040and\040abnormal\040heart\040sound\040recordings\040were\040studied\056\040Representation\040is\040based\040on\040Wigner\055Ville\040joint\040time\055frequency\040transformations\056\040The\040proposed\040methodology\040separates\040acoustic\040contributions\040of\040cardiac\040events\040simultaneously\040in\040pitch\054\040time\040and\040energy\056\040The\040resolution\040accuracy\040is\040superior\040to\040any\040other\040existing\040spectrogram\040method\056\040The\040characteristic\040energy\040signature\040of\040the\040innocent\040heart\040murmur\040in\040a\040child\040with\040the\040S3\040sound\040is\040presented\056\040It\040allows\040clear\040detection\040of\040S1\054\040S2\040and\040S3\040sounds\054\040S2\040split\054\040systolic\040murmur\054\040and\040intensity\040of\040these\040components\056\040The\040original\040signal\054\040heart\040sound\040power\040change\040with\040time\054\040time\055averaged\040frequency\054\040energy\040density\040spectra\040and\040instantaneous\040variations\040of\040power\040and\040frequency\057pitch\040with\040time\054\040are\040presented\056\040These\040data\040allow\040full\040quantitative\040characterization\040of\040heart\040sounds\040and\040murmurs\056\040High\040accuracy\040in\040both\040time\040and\040pitch\040resolution\040is\040demonstrated\056\040Resulting\040visual\040images\040have\040self\055referencing\040quality\054\040whereby\040individual\040features\040and\040their\040changes\040become\040immediately\040obvious\056)
/Keywords (04\040May\0402007\054\040Biomedical\040Engineering\040Online\054\040Heart\040sounds\054\040Spectrogram\054\040Sound\040power\054\040Heart\040murmur\054\040Sound\040energy\054\040Dalhousie\040University)
>>
endobj
